1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Unpopular opinion: meeting people is the easy part.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
You've met hundreds of people
you never saw again.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
First interactions are cheap. Everyone's friendly at an event.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:15,000
The second interaction
is the rare one. It says: that wasn't an accident.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,500
So stop optimizing for
meeting more people.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Optimize for seeing
the same person twice.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Try the 7-day plan. Link in bio.
